,"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#为什么选择-coaction","content":"这种内聚也有成本。Zustand 更小、更成熟，它的显式 selector 模型对小型 store 往往已经足够。Coaction 的差异主要集中在 `observer()`、缓存 getter、自然的 `this` 绑定 action，以及可选的共享运行时；它并不意味着每个 store 都应该变得更复杂。"},"17":{"id":"/zh/docs-15","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"目标"},"18":{"id":"/zh/docs-16","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"建议从这里开始"},"19":{"id":"/zh/docs-17","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"Vanilla、本地状态"},"20":{"id":"/zh/docs-18","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"`coaction`"},"21":{"id":"/zh/docs-19","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"React 自动渲染追踪"},"22":{"id":"/zh/docs-20","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"`coaction` + `@coaction/react`"},"23":{"id":"/zh/docs-21","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"Vue、Angular、Svelte 或 Solid"},"24":{"id":"/zh/docs-22","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"对应的 `@coaction/*` 框架包"},"25":{"id":"/zh/docs-23","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"Worker 或 SharedWorker 权威端"},"26":{"id":"/zh/docs-24","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"`coaction/shared`，或为框架 `create()` 传入 `worker`"},"27":{"id":"/zh/docs-25","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"保留现有 Zustand/MobX/Pinia 等运行时"},"28":{"id":"/zh/docs-26","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"对应的整店适配器"},"29":{"id":"/zh/docs-27","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"通过 Yjs 同步 Coaction 自有状态"},"30":{"id":"/zh/docs-28","page_id":"/zh/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs#选择起点","content":"在拥有状态的一端使用 `@coaction/yjs`"},"31":{"id":"/zh/docs-29","