/docs/concepts/computed#访问器-getter","content":"Getter 应保持纯函数，不应调用 `setState()`、修改外部状态，或依赖隐藏副作用产生不同结果。"},"54":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#使用-get-声明显式依赖","content":"store factory 的第二个参数可手工声明依赖："},"55":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#使用-get-声明显式依赖","content":"当显式声明让跨 slice 逻辑更清楚，或集成代码不应依赖隐式 getter read 时，使用这种形式。"},"56":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#使用-get-声明显式依赖","content":"无参数调用 `get()` 会返回当前根状态。在 slice factory 中，它适合读取另一 namespace，但更新仍必须通过 `set()`。"},"57":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#追踪粒度","content":"原生 getter 与 `get(deps, fn)` 读取冻结快照，依赖以 store/slice 字段为边界。因此 getter 中的 `this.user.name` 会因 `user.age` 变化而重新计算。使用 `get(s => [s.user.name], fn)` 时，依赖 selector 会重跑，但 name 不变时可以复用 `fn` 的结果。计算函数重跑和通知消费者是两件事：相同的 primitive 结果可以阻止下游执行。"},"58":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#追踪粒度","content":"React selector 与 `observer` 使用可回收的深层路径追踪。读取 `state.user.name` 的 selector 可以忽略仅改变 age 的 recipe。父对象 replacement、数组结构变化和 graph snapshot patches 可能扩大失效范围。数组元素按值读取：读取 `state.todos[0].title` 的 reader 依赖 `todos[0]` 本身，因此该元素内部的任何写入都会让 `observer` 重新渲染；selector 会重跑，但只有结果变化时才重新渲染。"},"59":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#可管理生命周期的派生读取","content":"可选入口 `coaction/derived` 提供归属 store 的缓存读取，不改变原生 getter 默认行为，也不会把这套运行时代码加入默认入口的 consumer bundle："},"60":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#可管理生命周期的派生读取","content":"`derivePath` 创建时复制路径，支持 string/number/symbol key；数据不存在时返回 `undefined`。它只选择 state data，不选择 action 或原生 computed getter。动态路径和 getter 组合请使用 `derive`。这两个 API 都不会把任意 `reduce`、`filter` 或 `sort` 自动变成增量算法。"},"61":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"`derive(store, selector)` 默认保留所有经过的对象身份依赖。`{ deep: true }` 显式选择值语义：为了读取子属性而经过父对象，不会自动保留父对象身份。JavaScript 的 `===`、`Object.is` 和 WeakMap 查询无法通过 property trap 识别，需要显式标记："},"62":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"age 变化会替换 user 对象，因此这里即使 name 不变也必须重算。`identity()` 返回原本的 readonly 对象；`whole()` 则为整体扫描返回自有 raw data，不能修改它。"},"63":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"数组元素是值，而不是 readonly 代理。通过下标读取、经扫描找到或由 getter 返回的元素，都是同一个被冻结的元素本身，无论从哪条路径得到都相等；同时存放在对象键上的对象，在两处也是同一个身份。读取元素即依赖它的身份：元素内部的任何写入都会使它获得新身份，而对同级元素的写入不会。在 `set()` 之外写入元素时，严格模式代码会抛出 `TypeError`，非严格模式脚本则静默忽略这次写入；两种情况下 state 都不会改变。"},"64":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"`filter`、`map`、`find`、`reduce`、`slice`、`for...of` 等读取全部元素且不修改数组的方法，只对整个数组登记一个依赖，并直接在数组本身上执行；回调中读取的其他 state 仍照常追踪。对于不是单个数组方法的遍历，例如带下标的循环或 record 的所有值，请使用 `whole()`。"},"65":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#对象身份是独立依赖","content":"直接返回 state 对象，或将它放进普通对象／数组的数据属性中，会自动保留 terminal dependency；带 cycle 的结果包装也受支持。追踪不会执行结果的 accessor，也不会遍历 opaque instance、函数或 closure；在这些位置携带 state 时，应在 selector 内用 `identity()` 标记。数组、空洞、symbol、null prototype、cycle 和共享引用保留现有 local-state contract。Date、Map、Set 和 class instance 仍是 atomic identity leaf，其内部 mutation 不会自动变得可观察。"},"66":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#结果比较","content":"默认使用 `Object.is`，包括 NaN 与正负零的区别。新对象即使字段相同，也属于不同结果；可以用 `equals` 显式复用等价派生数据："},"67":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#结果比较","content":"结果比较与依赖收集独立；比较函数应保持纯函数，其读取不会添加响应式依赖。即使复用结果，分支依赖也会重新协调。结果携带的 state 对象发生变化时仍会通知，包括身份稳定的 root/slice facade，避免 `equals` 隐藏实际 state 变化。默认不对任意 local graph 做结构深比较。"},"68":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"recipe 内的读取使用当前 store 的 draft，不更新已提交缓存，也不保留 draft proxy。recipe 抛错或 validator 拒绝后，已提交缓存保持有效；消费者在 commit 被接受后失效。selector 抛错后，缓存读取仍抛错，输入依赖变化后重新求值。可组合归属同一 store 的派生读取；这个 API 不负责跨 store 的事务协调。selector 必须是同步纯读取；`await` 后的工作不在追踪范围内，这不是 Resource/Suspense API。"},"69":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"每个读取保留当前依赖，直到调用 `dispose()` 或 `store.destroy()`。尚未读取的派生对象不会开启 patches。`dispose()` 可重复调用，会释放该读取的依赖与缓存，之后再次读取会抛错。停止某个消费者不会销毁 store 归属的派生对象，其他消费者仍可继续使用；原生 getter 的缓存仍采用其既有 store 生命周期。"},"70":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"请随 store 或另一个明确 owner 创建派生对象，不要在 React render 中创建，也不要把 `useMemo` 当成清理边界，否则废弃的 render 可能留下实例。已存在的 store 归属读取可以用于 selector 或 observer："},"71":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#事务归属与-react","content":"这里 `usePerson` 来自 `@coaction/react`。owner 结束时销毁 `displayName`，或销毁其 store；组件卸载会释放 React 订阅。SSR 的 store 和派生读取归属对应请求；shared client 使用已接受的镜像状态重新计算。派生定义和缓存不会进入 patches、history 或 transport payload。"},"72":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#独立信号原语","content":"`coaction` 导出的 `computed`、`signal`、`effect` 仍是 alien-signals 原语，适合独立 signal graph，但不具备 store 归属的销毁和 draft-aware 缓存。独立 computed 保守保留对象依赖；若结果是整个 root facade，需要显式 `whole(store.getState())` 读取来登记整体依赖。它们的 Coaction 路径记账持续到 store 生命周期结束；需要回收动态 store 依赖时，请使用 `derive`。初始嵌套数据中的普通 getter 仍会被求值成 data，不会递归注册成 computed 定义。"},"73":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#外部适配器","content":"原生 getter computed 属于 Coaction 自有状态。外部 adapter instance 不会自动获得 Coaction 缓存 getter 或 `get(deps, selector)` 语义；应由其自身运行时（MobX computed、Pinia getter、selector 或 machine state）负责派生状态。`derive` 和 `derivePath` 会明确拒绝外部 adapter。"},"74":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#性能预期","content":"稳定重复读取是缓存 getter 最强的路径。更新后，Coaction 仍需维护 readonly public-state 边界，并在下一次派生读取前刷新 computed 使用的 snapshot。微基准应被视为回归信号，而非普适结论；维护命令与解释见性能指南。"},"75":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#性能预期","content":"深层追踪适合稀疏读取。全量集合扫描继续使用读取冻结快照的原生 getter，也可以用 `derive(store, s => s.total)` 组合该 getter。若通过深层 proxy 遍历每个元素，只会增加追踪成本，不能省去求值。不可变更新仍需复制变化路径上的容器，flat array 的单点写入并不独立于数组长度。"},"76":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/computed#性能预期","content":"`pnpm benchmark:derived` 覆盖 1k/10k/50k 稀疏读取、10k 全量扫描、稳定缓存读取，以及尚未读取／已销毁派生对象的写入成本；已加入 `benchmark:check`。"},"77":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"page","content":"Slices","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices"},"78":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","content":"通过具名状态 factory 组合原生 Coaction store，并安全地跨 namespace 更新。"},"79":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#选择-slice-字段","content":"选择 slice 字段"},"80":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"为歧义对象声明模式"},"81":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"边界"},"82":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","content":"Slices 是将 Coaction 自有状态组织为多个 namespace 的原生 store shape。"},"83":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","content":"在 `set(() => ...)` 内，`this` 指向当前 slice；显式 `draft` 参数始终代表根 store，适合跨 slice 更新。"},"84":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#选择-slice-字段","content":"在 React 中，`observer()` 会追踪 render 期间读取的 slice 字段："},"85":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#选择-slice-字段","content":"也可以使用显式 selector："},"86":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`sliceMode` 有三个值："},"87":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`'single'`：把输入当作单一状态对象；"},"88":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`'slices'`：要求输入是 slice factory map；"},"89":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"`'auto'`：根据输入 shape 推断（兼容默认值）。"},"90":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#为歧义对象声明模式","content":"所有 enumerable value 都是 function 的对象存在歧义：它既可能是只有方法的单 store，也可能是 slice factory map。开发构建会在 `auto` 遇到这种 shape 时警告。请显式表达意图："},"91":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"slice key 与每个 slice 的根字段在初始化后固定。"},"92":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"从 `getState().counter` 解构的方法仍绑定到该 slice。"},"93":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"原生 slices 支持 local、shared-main 与 shared-client 模式。"},"94":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"外部状态适配器仅支持 whole store，不能作为 slice 嵌套。"},"95":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/slices#边界","content":"只有当 namespace 能澄清所有权时才使用 slices；小型 store 不必仅为模仿目录结构而拆分。"},"96":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"page","content":"状态与 action","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","核心概念"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions"},"97":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","content":"理解 Coaction 的不可变更新边界、固定 public schema、方法绑定、订阅与生命周期。"},"98":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"`set()` 外的状态不可变"},"99":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#根-schema-固定","content":"根 schema 固定"},"100":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#action-保持绑定","content":"Action 保持绑定"},"101":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#读取检查与订阅","content":"读取、检查与订阅"},"102":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#本地-patch-按需开启","content":"本地 patch 按需开启"},"103":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#所有权结束时销毁-store","content":"所有权结束时销毁 store"},"104":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"Coaction 暴露只读 public state。action 可以通过 `this` 读取，但所有 Coaction 自有状态写入必须发生在 `set()` 内："},"105":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"也可以显式使用根 draft："},"106":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions#set-外的状态不可变","content":"deep-partial 对象会合并已知字段；传入 `null` 是 no-op。应用代码通常应把更新放在具名 action 中，直接 `setState()` 更适合集成、测试与受控 imperative 更新。"},"107":{"id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/concepts/state-and-actions","tag