4-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"`coaction/derived`"},"292":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"旧的 `coaction/local` 和 `@coaction/react/local` 别名已经移除。此前使用默认入口的共享 store 必须切换到 `/shared`："},"293":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#选择对应入口","content":"默认入口会拒绝非 null 的共享选项，例如 `worker`、`transport` 和 `clientTransport`。\n显式传入 undefined 的选项仍被接受，方便 feature detection 和 SSR。本地入口不会把共享 transport 运行时打进 bundle。"},"294":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查底层写入与-middleware","content":"`store.apply(nextState)` 和 `store.apply(base, patches)` 都会发布 commit。传入 patches 时，base 必须是当前状态：\n使用 `apply(undefined, patches)` 省略 base，或传入 `getPureState()`。错误的 base 会在修改状态和发布 commit 前被拒绝。"},"295":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查底层写入与-middleware","content":"Adapter 作者应保留 Coaction 对 `store.apply` 的所有权，通过 `internal.externalApply` 提供自身 runtime 的写入函数。\nMiddleware 应使用 StoreCommit hooks 观察所有受支持的 transition，包括不经过 `apply` 的写入。"},"296":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查底层写入与-middleware","content":"不要假设 patch pair 总是包含叶子路径。位置相关编辑可能回退到发生变化的 top-level key replacement；\n本地图结构可能需要 `path: []` 的完整 root snapshot。Replay 必须保留已经提交的值和引用拓扑。\n本地循环引用可以作为完整值用于初始化或 replacement；从 draft 引用构造循环、编辑循环 draft 内部仍不属于受支持的 recipe contract。\n这些本地保证不会扩展共享 JSON contract。"},"297":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-react-和-computed-假设","content":"React 18 和 19 受到支持并经过测试，React 17 已不在 peer range 中。\n服务端 selector 读取当前状态，与 whole-state 和 observer reader 一致。确实需要初始状态时，请显式使用 `getInitialState()`。\nSSR 应使用请求独立的 store，并准备一致的服务端与客户端 hydration 数据。"},"298":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-react-和-computed-假设","content":"原生 getter 仍以 store/slice 字段为依赖边界。React selector 和 `observer` 使用深层路径追踪；\n`derive(..., { deep: true })` 为可管理生命周期的 computed selector 显式开启深层追踪。\nIdentity、生命周期和失效边界详见 computed state。"},"299":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查远程同步","content":"`@coaction/sync` 要求持久化存储和 JSON 状态。不受支持的本地写入会在 commit 前被拒绝。\nCheckpoint 包含 `formatVersion`；不受支持的版本和格式错误的 checkpoint 会被拒绝，并保留原有存储内容。\n没有版本字段的旧 checkpoint 按 format 1 读取。"},"300":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查远程同步","content":"升级 CRUD、Supabase 或 Firestore 集成时，请检查对应 README：CRUD adapter 保留远程 base，\nSupabase 的 schema 配置同时应用于读写，Firestore 分离读取来源与写入地址。\n配置和错误处理见远程同步。"},"301":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查远程同步","content":"响应式追踪、共享权威和远程同步是独立能力。本地 store 不需要 Worker 也能与服务器同步；\n共享 mirror 跟随同一个权威端，并不是可以独立分叉再合并的远程副本。"},"302":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-41-中的-mutative-2","content":"Coaction 4.1 依赖 Mutative 2，`@coaction/history`\n依赖以 Mutative 2 为 peer 的 Travels 3。Coaction 的 API 没有变化。\n如果应用直接导入 `mutative`，请一并升级到 2.0；以 Mutative 1 为 peer 的库（例如 `zustand-mutative` 1）\n需要替换为支持 Mutative 2 的版本，否则 npm 会在安装 `@coaction/history` 时以 `ERESOLVE` 停止。"},"303":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-41-中的-mutative-2","content":"Commit 中的 patch 遵循 Mutative 2：嵌套值的 patch 排在父级之前，被移动的 draft 由父级的 patch 携带。\n它们 replay 后得到相同的状态，因此只有比较 patch 数组的测试需要更新预期。生产构建中 Mutative 抛出的错误为\n`Minified Mutative error #<code>`，请匹配错误码，并在每个 bundle 中定义 `process.env.NODE_ENV`。\n无 bundler 加载方式和开发构建新增的 draft 检查，见仓库指南。"},"304":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-42-中的数组元素与-getinitialstate","content":"Coaction 4.2 把数组元素作为冻结的值交出，而不是 readonly 代理。reader 依赖它读取的每个元素的身份，\n因此渲染 `todos[0].title` 的 `observer()` 会在 `todos[0]` 内部的任何写入后重新渲染；`filter` 等只读数组方法\n只对整个数组登记一个依赖，`find`、`at` 这类提前结束的方法也一样。如果某个组件比以前渲染得更频繁，请改用 selector 读取该字段或扫描结果，\nselector 只在结果变化时才重新渲染。通过对象键访问的对象仍按原来的方式追踪。"},"305":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/migrating-to-v4#检查-42-中的数组元素与-getinitialstate","content":"在 `set()` 之外写入元素时，严格模式代码会抛出引擎的 `TypeError`，非严格模式脚本则静默忽略这次写入，\n不再抛出 Coaction 的直接修改错误。`getInitialState()` 返回初始状态的副本，结构与工厂返回的对象相同，\n每次调用返回同一个对象，而不再是工厂返回的对象本身。`@coaction/react` 新增可选的 whole selector：\n`useStore(selector, { whole: true })`，它的 selector 拿到的是 store 自己的数据，绝不能修改。\n数组的状态只有元素：`create()` 和 `setState({ ... })` 不再保留数组上的命名属性和 symbol（recipe 第一次写入该数组时本来就会丢掉它们），\n并在开发环境警告一次。这类值请放在数组旁边的对象里。\n仓库指南逐项对比了与 4.1 的差别。"},"306":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"page","content":"性能与 bundle 边界","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance"},"307":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","content":"诚实理解 Coaction benchmark，并让本地应用使用无 transport 的入口。"},"308":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"选择 local 入口"},"309":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"运行维护的检查"},"310":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#理解派生状态-tradeoff","content":"理解派生状态 tradeoff"},"311":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"渲染性能"},"312":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"实用 checklist"},"313":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","content":"只有当场景、runtime、状态 shape 与包版本都可见时，性能结论才有意义。Coaction 将 benchmark script 保存在仓库中，便于重新生成结果，而不是把数字当成永久事实。"},"314":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"Vanilla 本地 store 应写为："},"315":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"该静态边界排除共享 protocol、epoch、重连与 transport module。共享运行时使用 `coaction/shared`，React 中使用 `@coaction/react/shared`；默认 `@coaction/react` 入口也只包含 local 运行时。"},"316":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#选择-local-入口","content":"仓库的 bundle budget 测量发布入口与 tree-shaken consumer fixture。它们是回归门禁，不代表应用 bundle 必然等于预算数字；最终结果还取决于应用 bundler 保留的外部依赖。"},"317":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`package:size` 检查发布入口预算与 core entry 隔离；"},"318":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark` 对比大型 update path，包括 Coaction draft 与 Zustand + Immer；"},"319":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark:zustand-positioning` 分离 stable derived read 与 update-then-read；"},"320":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark:check` 以 CI 浮动余量执行回归下限。"},"321":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"`benchmark:derived` 在独立进程中使用构建后的入口，覆盖稀疏路径、相关／无关写入、全量扫描、缓存读取，以及尚未读取／已销毁的 owner。它已加入 `benchmark:check`；全量 deep scan 的结果用于展示追踪成本，原生 getter 提供 coarse scan 基线。"},"322":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#运行维护的检查","content":"不能仅为让失败结果变绿而降低阈值。阈值变化必须有经过 review 的 runtime semantic 或 benchmark methodology 理由。"},"323":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#理解派生状态-tradeoff","content":"缓存 accessor 让稳定重复读取极快。更新后，Coaction 仍需维护 readonly public-state 边界，并更新 computed traversal 使用的 snapshot。因此“更新后读取派生值”与稳定缓存读取是不同路径。"},"324":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#理解派生状态-tradeoff","content":"除非集成明确需要 journal，否则不必设置 `enablePatches`。Commit hooks、共享 transport 和部分追踪路径会自动请求 patches。符合条件的小型依赖集合可以直接比较写入前后的已观察值，避免生成 patches；缓存 getter 快照、patch middleware 和较大的依赖集合仍保留 patch 路径。普通 `subscribe()` listener 自身不会请求 patches。"},"325":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#理解派生状态-tradeoff","content":"不要把其中一个 case 发布为普适的“快于 Zustand”结论。Zustand 可以通过存储派生值实现常量读取，但应用 action 必须负责一致性。Coaction 的价值是运行时维护的缓存派生，而非赢下每个 mutation microbenchmark。"},"326":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"原生 immutable store 上的 `useStore(selector)` 与 `observer()` 都使用可回收的深层路径追踪。读取 `state.user.name` 的 reader 可以在仅更新 age 的 recipe 后继续使用缓存。Selector 仍以 `Object.is` 比较结果；`observer()` 直接收集 render 中的读取，不需要额外 selector。请分别测量 selector 执行次数与组件 render 次数。"},"327":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"数组元素是值：reader 依赖它读取的每个元素的身份，`filter`、`map` 等数组方法只对整个数组登记一个依赖。渲染 `todos[0].title` 的 `observer()` 会在 `todos[0]` 内部的任何写入后重新渲染，渲染扫描结果的 `observer()` 会在任一元素被写入后重新渲染。返回该字段或扫描结果的 selector 会重跑，但只有结果变化时才重新渲染。"},"328":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"原生 getter 与 `get(deps, fn)` 仍以 store/slice 字段为边界。读取 `this.user.name` 的 getter 可能因 `user.age` 变化而重算，即使结果相同、消费者没有额外工作。需要更细依赖的派生读取可使用 `derive(..., { deep: true })` 或 `derivePath`。"},"329":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#渲染性能","content":"父对象 replacement、数组结构变化和 graph snapshot patches 可能扩大失效范围；外部 adapter 遵守各自的更新和快照 contract。具体边界见 computed 追踪粒度。"},"330":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"Vanilla 本地状态导入 `coaction`；"},"331":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"非必要时不设置 `enablePatches`，同时考虑会自动请求 patches 的消费者；"},"332":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"缓存 getter 用于重复派生读取，不承载副作用；"},"333":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"在确实减少 selector 组合时使用 `observer()`；"},"334":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"若 `observer()` 会因元素中其他字段的写入而重新渲染，改用 selector 读取数组元素的字段或扫描结果；"},"335":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"profile production build 与代表性状态；"},"336":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/performance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/performance#实用-checklist","content":"把 benchmark floor 当作回归检测，并在目标机器重跑可发布数字。"},"337":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"page","content":"什么时候不该用 Coaction","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use"},"338":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","content":"一份诚实的边界清单——哪些场景 Coaction 是错误的选择，哪些场景它没有真正的对手。"},"339":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#跳过-coaction-的情况","content":"跳过 Coaction 的情况"},"340":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#只有普通的单标签页状态","content":"只有普通的单标签页状态"},"341":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#共享状态不是-json-形状","content":"共享状态不是 JSON 形状"},"342":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#调用点无法-await-动作","content":"调用点无法 await 动作"},"343":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#实测的更新热路径达不到性能预算","content":"实测的更新热路径达不到性能预算"},"344":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#你需要一个已经存在的生态","content":"你需要一个已经存在的生态"},"345":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#你的浏览器矩阵惩罚-sharedworker","content":"你的浏览器矩阵惩罚 SharedWorker"},"346":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"应该选择 Coaction 的情况"},"347":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#一条经验法则","content":"一条经验法则"},"348":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","content":"大多数应用不需要 Coaction。如果只是普通的单页客户端状态，Zustand 或 Jotai 加几个 selector\n是更小、更安全的依赖，“功能更强”并不构成支付切换成本的理由。这一页存在的意义，是让你快速做出\n判断，也让 Coaction 真正没有对位方案的场景容易被找到。"},"349":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","content":"这一页刻意反营销。如果你的情况落在「跳过它」清单里，那就跳过——你需要的 Coaction 并不是\n它实际提供的东西。"},"350":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#只有普通的单标签页状态","content":"一个表单、一个计数器、一个设置面板。Coaction 的只读状态和响应式运行时成本可能超过这些需求的收益。\n默认 `coaction` 与 `@coaction/react` 入口排除了共享 transport 运行时；本地 store 不会把未启用的 transport 打进 bundle。\n如果更小的模型已经足够，**考虑 Zustand、Jotai 或组件本地状态**。当共享派生或读取追踪能减少大量应用代码时，\nCoaction 的 local 运行时就可能有价值，即使应用始终不需要 Worker。"},"351":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#共享状态不是-json-形状","content":"跨共享边界的一切——状态、动作参数、返回值——必须是纯 JSON 树：没有 `Date`、没有 `Map`、\n没有类实例、没有 `undefined`、没有循环引用。用富对象构建的领域模型要先做一次序列化重设计\n才能共享，而这个重设计才是真正的成本，不是那一次 store 调用。这类状态请保持 local，或者\n接受一层映射。具体规则见 JSON contract。"},"352":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#调用点无法-await-动作","content":"client mirror 的动作在权威端执行并返回 Promise。必须同步读取结果的 UI——无乐观更新的流程、\n渲染期读取动作结果、往返延迟即是回归的热路径——应该保持权威在本地，而不是强行让每次读取\n经过 transport。"},"353":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#实测的更新热路径达不到性能预算","content":"不要从一个微基准推导出普遍的写入惩罚。在这次 4.0 测量中，每次更新一个元素后都会读取一个遍历 1,000 项的\n派生总值；Coaction 的吞吐量约为对应 Zustand selector 场景的 55%，与手工维护派生字段的方案差距更大。\n另一项批量基准则表明，其他更新形状可能接近持平，也可能让 Mutative 占优。对于高频拖拽、动画帧和实时数据流\n的 tick 处理，请测量有代表性的实际操作；如果达不到所需预算，再跳过 Coaction。"},"354":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#你需要一个已经存在的生态","content":"成熟的 devtools、庞大的中间件货架、每个边角问题都有社区答案。Coaction 是一个专注的项目，\n不是一个生态。在大面积押注之前先看 support matrix。"},"355":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#你的浏览器矩阵惩罚-sharedworker","content":"Module SharedWorker 在各浏览器和隐私模式下表现不一致。如果所有标签页必须共享同一个状态\n实例，请把 `SharedWorker` 缺失当作硬失败，而不是依赖 local fallback\n碰运气。只需要「最终一致」的跨标签页状态，往往 `BroadcastChannel` + 持久化就够了——机制\n更简单，保证更弱。"},"356":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**一份状态，多个标签页。** SharedWorker 权威 + 镜像客户端——跨标签页 todos\ndemo\n在三个引擎上完整回放跨标签页编辑会话。"},"357":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**重计算移出主线程。** 把写权威放进 Web Worker，主线程从 mirror 同步读取。"},"358":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**想要 signals 的体验但不离开 `create()` 的世界。** Zustand 风格 store + 渲染追踪 +\n缓存 computed。"},"359":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**渐进采用很重要。** Zustand adapter 先包住现有 store，\nworker 与跨标签页模式以后再开，调用点不用重写。"},"360":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#应该选择-coaction-的情况","content":"**实时协作。** Yjs binding 把 CRDT 状态放进同一个 store 接口。"},"361":{"id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guides/when-not-to-use#一条经验法则","content":"> 当问题的形状是多线程、多标签页，或者派生状态多到不想手写 memo 时，采用 Coaction；\n> 否则选更小的那个。"},"362":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","type":"page","content":"外部状态适配器","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters"},"363":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","content":"将现有 Zustand、MobX、Pinia、Jotai、Redux、Valtio 或 XState 运行时保留为 whole-store 集成。"},"364":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"支持矩阵"},"365":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#zustand-示例","content":"Zustand 示例"},"366":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#mobx-示例","content":"MobX 示例"},"367":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#piniajotaireduxvaltio-与-xstate","content":"Pinia、Jotai、Redux、Valtio 与 XState"},"368":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#编写-adapter","content":"编写 adapter"},"369":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#写入边界","content":"写入边界"},"370":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","content":"外部状态 adapter 把完整的第三方 runtime 接入 Coaction。外部 runtime 保留其原生 mutation 与 derived-state 语义；Coaction 提供 store、框架、生命周期，以及对部分 adapter 维护的共享方法执行 surface。"},"371":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","content":"Binder-backed adapter 不是原生 slice。不要把适配后的外部 store 放在 Coaction\nslice key 下。"},"372":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integratio