ons/adapters-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"恢复为权威 snapshot"},"407":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"XState"},"408":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"`@coaction/xstate`"},"409":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"支持"},"410":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"不支持"},"411":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"N/A"},"412":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#支持矩阵","content":"共享支持意味着 Coaction 方法执行是维护的 contract；它不保证对任意外部 runtime 的 out-of-band write 都能跨 authority/client 传播。"},"413":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#zustand-示例","content":"当 Zustand store 本身必须保持 public API，或其他模块仍直接消费它时使用此路径。Coaction 拥有的新 store 应优先采用原生状态模型。"},"414":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#mobx-示例","content":"外部 runtime 拥有其 mutable object。直接写到可变 adapter 的未知根属性不会被提升到 Coaction 固定的 raw/public schema。"},"415":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#piniajotaireduxvaltio-与-xstate","content":"这些包暴露 `bind*` helper，并在需要时提供 `adapt()` wrapper："},"416":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#piniajotaireduxvaltio-与-xstate","content":"XState 会阻止 `setState()`，应发送 actor event。Redux 与 XState 当前只维护本地 contract。"},"417":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#编写-adapter","content":"自定义 adapter 从 `coaction/adapter` 导入 `defineExternalStoreAdapter()`。它必须保留 core `Store` 生命周期，在直接外部不可变写入后通知 Coaction，并通过 contract test 声明支持边界。开始前请阅读贡献指南。"},"418":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#写入边界","content":"`store.apply` 属于 Coaction。adapter 通过设置 `internal.externalApply` 说明如何把一次改动\n写进自己的 runtime，这就是它在这里的全部职责 —— Coaction 负责算出 patch pair、运行 commit\nvalidator、调用这个 writer，然后发布 commit。"},"419":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#写入边界","content":"如果 adapter 只是想拒绝直接写入（因为它的 runtime 只通过自己的通道接受改动），那它根本不需要\nwriter —— 从 `internal.assertMutationAllowed` 拒绝，让普通的 `apply` 去做事即可。"},"420":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/adapters#写入边界","content":"adapter 过去是直接替换 `store.apply` 的。那让它承担了并不想要的 commit 语义，而且会丢弃\nmiddleware 对 `apply` 的包装 —— 因为 middleware 先于 binder 运行。"},"421":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"page","content":"框架集成","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks"},"422":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","content":"将同一套 Coaction store 模型连接到 React、Vue、Angular、Svelte 或 Solid。"},"423":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"React"},"424":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"Whole selector"},"425":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"服务端渲染"},"426":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#vue","content":"Vue"},"427":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#angular","content":"Angular"},"428":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#svelte","content":"Svelte"},"429":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#solid","content":"Solid"},"430":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#共享模式说明","content":"共享模式说明"},"431":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","content":"框架包使用各自生态原生的 reactive primitive 包装 core `Store` contract。状态创建、action、computed getter、slices 与共享模式规则仍由 core 提供。"},"432":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"`@coaction/react` 支持 React 18 与 19。CI 会分别安装这两个版本并跑完整测试,\n所以这个范围是被验证过的,不是声明。"},"433":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"在 `observer()` 内，无 selector 的 hook 调用会追踪 render 期间读取的字段；在其外部则订阅整个 store。意图更清楚时可以显式选择："},"434":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#react","content":"`<Observer>` 可创建更小的追踪区域，`useCounter.auto()` 返回缓存字段 selector map。"},"435":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"如果 selector 本来就要扫描大部分 state，逐个追踪读取几乎没有收益。传入 `{ whole: true }`，让它直接在 store 的纯数据上运行："},"436":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"whole selector 接收的是 `getPureState()`：store 自有的纯对象数据，不含 getter 和方法。它不登记任何依赖，每次提交都会重新运行；只有结果按 `Object.is`（或你传入的 `equals`）判断发生变化时，组件才重新渲染。当没有 tracked selector 或 `observer()` 读取某个 store 时，它的写入会跳过追踪所需的 patch 记账。"},"437":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#whole-selector","content":"selector 拿到的是 store 自己的数据：只读，不要修改。每个 hook 调用只用一种模式，因为在 `{ whole: true }` 与 tracked selector 之间切换会改变它运行的 hooks。"},"438":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"服务端没有任何可订阅的东西，所以读取 store 的每一种方式都只是一次普通读取，读到的是那一刻的\n状态 —— selector、不带 selector 的调用、`observer` 三者一致。"},"439":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"这在渲染之前已经有写入时才真正重要：请求预加载数据、hydration middleware、初始化的第二阶段。\n三者都会报告被写入的那个值，而这也正是客户端 hydrate 时比对的值，所以 React 会接受这段\nmarkup，而不是报告 mismatch 并重新渲染整棵树。"},"440":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#服务端渲染","content":"如果你要的是 store 创建时的值，就显式去取："},"441":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#vue","content":"`useCounter({ autoSelector: true })` 为已知字段返回 computed ref。方法可直接调用，数据 ref 通过 `.value` 读取。"},"442":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#angular","content":"`select()` 为 selector 结果返回 Angular signal-like accessor。"},"443":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#svelte","content":"Selector 调用返回 readable Svelte store。"},"444":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#solid","content":"Selector 结果是 Solid accessor。"},"445":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#共享模式说明","content":"框架包可以包装 client mirror。即使同一个方法在 local store 中同步，只要 store 由 Worker 或 SharedWorker 创建，它就会返回 Promise；此时应 await mutation。"},"446":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/frameworks#共享模式说明","content":"生成的 selector map 基于初始化期间已知的 schema。声明 record 内的动态 path 应使用显式 selector，不要期待 auto-selector map 自动增长。"},"447":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"page","content":"Logger、persist 与 history","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware"},"448":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","content":"通过 middleware 为 Coaction 自有 store 添加诊断、持久化与 undo/redo。"},"449":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#logger","content":"Logger"},"450":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#persist","content":"Persist"},"451":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#history","content":"History"},"452":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"共享模式放置规则"},"453":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","content":"Middleware 在创建期间接收 store，可以装饰方法或附加 API。请通过复数 `middlewares` option 按数组顺序传入。"},"454":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#logger","content":"你可以注入兼容 console 的 logger。Serialized mode 能安全处理循环诊断值与 BigInt；日志不会削弱共享 JSON contract。"},"455":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#logger","content":"需要权威端 action 与 patch 诊断时，把 logger 安装在 authority；client logger 只能看到镜像更新与代理调用。"},"456":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"t