"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"Logger"},"466":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"467":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"468":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"可见性有限"},"469":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"Persist"},"470":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"471":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"472":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"拒绝"},"473":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"History"},"474":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"475":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"支持"},"476":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"拒绝"},"477":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"持久化与 time travel 都是写入，应安装在 authority store，让所有 client 观察同一结果。不要把 client-local persist 或 undo 描述为权威状态。"},"478":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/middleware#共享模式放置规则","content":"`persist` 与 `history` 会协调，避免 hydration 产生误导性的 undo entry。"},"479":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"page","content":"本地优先同步","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync"},"480":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"通过持久 outbox 与 rebase，让 Coaction store 离线可用并与服务端收敛。"},"481":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#查看队列","content":"查看队列"},"482":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"后端"},"483":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#冲突","content":"冲突"},"484":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"状态必须是 JSON"},"485":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#存储","content":"存储"},"486":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#投递语义","content":"投递语义"},"487":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"`@coaction/sync` 是 middleware。store 仍然是普通的 Coaction store —— action、\nselector、`observer`、history 都不变 —— 它产生的每一次 commit 同时会排队发往服务端。"},"488":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"写入立即在本地生效。在发送任何东西之前，它先被写进持久 outbox，所以写入与投递之间\n崩溃是可恢复的；而一次 pull 会把仍在排队的写入 rebase 到服务端发来的内容之上。"},"489":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","content":"这不是共享权威。同步的 store 自己拥有状态并与远端\n收敛；共享 store 的镜像是另一个 JavaScript 上下文中同一个权威端的视图。两者可以组合，\n互不蕴含。"},"490":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#查看队列","content":"`getPending()` 返回的是副本。这个队列是客户端欠服务端的东西，rebase 会把它当作自己的\n工作集读回来，所以外部无法意外改动它。"},"491":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"引入"},"492":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"后端"},"493":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync`"},"494":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`createFetchSyncAdapter` —— HTTP 上的 JSON"},"495":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/crud`"},"496":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`createCrudSyncAdapter` —— 面向记录的 API"},"497":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/supabase`"},"498":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"Postgres 表，可选 changes-since cursor 与 realtime"},"499":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/firestore`"},"500":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"Firestore collection 或 query，可选 `onSnapshot`"},"501":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`@coaction/sync/query`"},"502":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"TanStack Query"},"503":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"一个 adapter 就是两个函数，所以这里没列出的后端也只是一个 `pull` 和一个 `push`："},"504":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#后端","content":"`push` 返回远端已持久接受的 id。没有被确认的会留在队列里并重试。"},"505":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#冲突","content":"当一次 pull 带来的改动与仍在排队的写入重叠时，默认保留本地写入。\n`conflict: 'remote-wins'` 保留远端的；传函数则逐条 mutation 决定："},"506":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#冲突","content":"每次调用拿到的都是各自独立的副本，所以在传入内容上直接操作的 resolver 既不会干扰\nrebase，也不会影响下一次调用。"},"507":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"outbox、乐观快照与 adapter 对远端的视图都以 JSON 存储，所以 JSON 表达不了的状态不会被\n持久化 —— 它会被悄悄改变。`Date` 回来变成字符串，`Map` 回来变成 `{}`。"},"508":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"引入这类值的写入会在**提交之前**被拒绝，所以错误会抵达调用方，store 保持它能承载的状态。\n日期用 ISO 字符串或 epoch 数字，键值集合用 record，set 用数组。"},"509":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#状态必须是-json","content":"`sync()` 不能挂在外部 mutable adapter 上 —— MobX、Valtio 与 Pinia 暴露的是\naccessor-backed state，这个契约在 store 构建时就会拒绝它。"},"510":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#存储","content":"默认使用 `localStorage`。可以传入 `storage`，或用 `@coaction/sync/indexeddb`\n获得更大的持久存储："},"511":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#存储","content":"没有静默回退到内存：没有持久写入位置的运行时会被拒绝，因为 outbox 能在崩溃后存活正是\n它存在的理由。"},"512":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#投递语义","content":"mutation 是**至少一次**投递。远端提交一次写入、到确认抵达持久存储之间的窗口无法从客户端\n关闭，所以在这个窗口内崩溃意味着重启后会再发一次。请把 mutation 的 `id` 当作幂等键处理。"},"513":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/sync#投递语义","content":"包 README\n涵盖持久 checkpoint 格式、各内置 adapter 在重放下的保证，以及 CRUD baseline。"},"514":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","type":"page","content":"Yjs 协作","breadcrumbs