js#存储与同步模型","content":"状态位于 `doc.getMap(key).get('state')`；"},"525":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"嵌套对象和数组转换为 `Y.Map` 与 `Y.Array`；"},"526":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"本地 Coaction change 与上次同步 snapshot 做 diff；"},"527":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"远端 Yjs update 会 replay 到 Coaction；"},"528":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"方法与 computed getter 不属于同步 payload。"},"529":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#存储与同步模型","content":"默认 key 为 `coaction:${store.name}`。"},"530":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#冲突语义","content":"对不同字段的并发编辑可以通过 Yjs 合并；同一 scalar field 的冲突遵循 Yjs 语义，对该值可近似理解为 last-writer-wins。需要交换律的操作（如分布式 counter）应使用 CRDT-native Yjs structure 或 operation 建模，而不是不断替换 scalar。"},"531":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#要求与限制","content":"同步状态应保持 plain 且可序列化；"},"532":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#要求与限制","content":"Yjs binding 支持 local 与 shared-main，不支持 shared client；"},"533":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs#要求与限制","content":"只绑定拥有状态的一端，client mirror 不能建立第二个协作权威；"},"534":{"id":"/zh/docs/integrations/yjs-19","page_id":"