ing","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#等待-action-对镜像可见","content":"等待 action 对镜像可见"},"614":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#action-执行期间权威端变化","content":"Action 执行期间权威端变化"},"615":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#dedicated-worker","content":"Dedicated Worker 为一个页面提供独立的权威生命周期："},"616":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#dedicated-worker","content":"当 client 不再拥有连接时销毁 Coaction store；根据应用所有权模型决定何时终止 Worker。"},"617":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"一个可复用模块可在页面 runtime 中创建 SharedWorker，并在 Worker runtime 内成为权威端："},"618":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"每个标签页得到一个 client mirror，SharedWorker 拥有唯一状态实例。显式传入值为 `undefined` 的\n`worker` key 时，store 会降级为 local authority。其 `getState()` action 仍返回 Promise，state、\naction 参数与返回值也继续遵守 shared JSON contract，因此 await 后的调用点可以在两种模式间迁移。"},"619":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"降级后的标签页各自持有独立状态。如果要求所有标签页共享同一状态，请把 SharedWorker 缺失当作\n硬错误处理，而不是依赖降级。降级 store 的 `share === false`，并在本地拥有权威状态，因此底层\n`setState()` 与 `apply()` 仍然可用。请始终通过 `getState()` 调用 action，并在读取结果前 await。"},"620":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#跨标签页-sharedworker","content":"如果 `new SharedWorker(...)` 在调用 `create()` 之前就抛出异常，Coaction 无法捕获。只有当产品\n确实允许 local fallback 时，应用才应自行捕获构造失败并保留 `undefined`。已经存在但在初始化\n期间失败的 worker 或 transport 会显式报错，不会静默改变 authority model。"},"621":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制权威端-surface","content":"权威端只暴露从 store 中发现的方法路径，`transportPolicy` 可进一步收紧："},"622":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制权威端-surface","content":"`allowedActions` 是方法路径 allowlist；"},"623":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制权威端-surface","content":"`authorize` 接收已解码 JSON execute 或 full-sync request；"},"624":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制权威端-surface","content":"`mapError` 可以返回刻意向 client 公开的消息。"},"625":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#限制权威端-surface","content":"未预期的 action error 会被脱敏为 `Remote action failed`，原始错误留在权威端。Policy code 是可信应用代码，应尽量保持无副作用。"},"626":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect#epoch-与-sequence-恢复","content":"每个权威生命周期拥有唯一 epoch，sequence 从 0 开始。client 会："},"627":{"id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconnect","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/shared/workers-and-reconne