/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`false`、`'main'` 或 `'client'`"},"711":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`isSliceStore`"},"712":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"输入是否被 materialize 为 slices"},"713":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`getState()`"},"714":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"Public 数据、绑定方法与 computed getter"},"715":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`getPureState()`"},"716":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"仅数据表示"},"717":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`getInitialState()`"},"718":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"初始状态的副本，结构与工厂返回的对象相同"},"719":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`setState(next)`"},"720":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"合并 deep partial 或运行 draft updater；client 拒绝"},"721":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`subscribe(listener)`"},"722":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"订阅并返回 unsubscribe function"},"723":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`apply(state?, patches?)`"},"724":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"底层集成/transport 更新；client 拒绝"},"725":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"`destroy()`"},"726":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"幂等清理订阅、集成与 transport"},"727":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"应用代码应优先使用具名 action，而不是 `apply()`；后者是 transport、middleware 与 adapter 的底层 contract。"},"728":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#store-method-与字段","content":"两种形式都会发布 commit，因此这样做出的 transition 对 `onStoreCommit` 以及基于它构建的\n一切（history、sync、devtool）都是可见的。带 patches 时，`state` 必须是 store 当前持有的\n状态：省略它，或传 `getPureState()`。一对 patch 描述的是对当前状态的改动，应用到别的基准上\n会让 store 落到它自己的 commit 到不了的地方，因此会被拒绝。"},"729":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#computed-声明","content":"无参数调用 `get()` 读取当前根状态。"},"730":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#生命周期-helper","content":"`onStoreReady(store, callback)` 将工作延迟到状态与集成完整 materialize 之后。callback 可返回在 `destroy()` 时运行的 cleanup。"},"731":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#生命周期-helper","content":"`wrapStore(store)` 提供给需要 callable store shape 的框架与集成作者。"},"732":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#signal-primitives","content":"`coaction` 与 `coaction/shared` re-export 高级 `alien-signals` primitive，包括 `signal`、`computed`、`effect`、`effectScope`、batch helper 与 type guard。普通应用派生状态仍应使用 getter 或 `get(deps, selector)`。"},"733":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#adapter-入口","content":"`coaction/adapter` 暴露 `defineExternalStoreAdapter()`（兼容别名 `createBinder()`）、mutable-adapter snapshot helper、根替换 helper、schema error 与 patch path safety utility。它面向集成作者，不用于普通状态更新。"},"734":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#adapter-入口","content":"该入口也导出 `onStoreCommit`、`onStoreCommitValidate`、`onStoreCommitPrepare` 和 `replayStorePatches`。\nHook 时机、验证、replay 和生命周期见 Store commits。"},"735":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/core-api#adapter-入口","content":"逐 symbol 生成的 TypeDoc 见仓库 API 目录。"},"736":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq"},"737":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","content":"直接回答本地使用、selector、序列化、schema、Worker、adapter 与 DevTools 问题。"},"738":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#不使用-worker-可以用-coaction-吗","content":"不使用 Worker 可以用 Coaction 吗？"},"739":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#react-中必须使用-observer-吗","content":"React 中必须使用 `observer()` 吗？"},"740":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#getter-每次读取都会重新计算吗","content":"Getter 每次读取都会重新计算吗？"},"741":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么直接-mutation-会抛错","content":"为什么直接 mutation 会抛错？"},"742":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以稍后添加状态-key-吗","content":"可以稍后添加状态 key 吗？"},"743":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-client-action-返回-promise","content":"为什么 client action 返回 Promise？"},"744":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-jsonstringify-可用的值仍被共享模式拒绝","content":"为什么 `JSON.stringify()` 可用的值仍被共享模式拒绝？"},"745":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗？"},"746":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以在-shared-client-上-persist-或-undo-吗","content":"可以在 shared client 上 persist 或 undo 吗？"},"747":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#adapter-可以作为一个-slice-吗","content":"Adapter 可以作为一个 slice 吗？"},"748":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-包含-signal-primitive-吗","content":"Coaction 包含 signal primitive 吗？"},"749":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-有-redux-devtools-集成吗","content":"Coaction 有 Redux DevTools 集成吗？"},"750":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#什么时候应该选择-zustand","content":"什么时候应该选择 Zustand？"},"751":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#不使用-worker-可以用-coaction-吗","content":"可以。本地模式是建议起点，提供完整原生状态、action、computed、slices 与框架体验。Vanilla 本地应用应导入 `coaction`。"},"752":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#react-中必须使用-observer-吗","content":"不必。不使用 `observer()` 时，`useStore()` 订阅整个 store。也可以调用 `useStore(selector)`，或使用 `useStore.auto()` 返回的缓存 map。"},"753":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#react-中必须使用-observer-吗","content":"`observer()` 才会增加自动 store/slice 字段追踪。"},"754":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#getter-每次读取都会重新计算吗","content":"不会。原生访问器 getter 通过 signal runtime 缓存，并在依赖变化时失效。请保持 getter 纯净。"},"755":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么直接-mutation-会抛错","content":"Coaction public state 不可变。请在 `set()` 内写入，让运行时能够提交状态、使 computed 失效、通知 subscriber，并在需要时生成 patch。"},"756":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以稍后添加状态-key-吗","content":"不能添加到 public 根。Coaction 初始化后固定根 schema；请预先声明 record 或 array field，再向其中增加动态 entry。"},"757":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-client-action-返回-promise","content":"共享 client 不在本地执行方法。它将方法路径和参数发送给 authority，等待结果，再等待镜像到达权威端报告的 sequence。"},"758":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#为什么-jsonstringify-可用的值仍被共享模式拒绝","content":"`JSON.stringify()` 会静默归一化或丢弃某些值。Coaction 要求无损 JSON tree，因此拒绝 `undefined`、非有限数、`-0`、accessor、platform object、sparse array、cycle 与重复引用。"},"759":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"可以，初始化和完整值替换会保留这些引用关系。原生 recipe 仍然使用 Mutative draft，\n不支持用 draft 引用创建循环，也不支持进入循环结构内部进行 draft 编辑。\n应先用普通对象构造完整的新值，再替换对应字段："},"760":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"也可以在 recipe 内把这个完整值赋给字段。如果循环包含根节点，使用 `store.apply(nextState)`\n替换整个状态。传入 store 后，不要继续修改这个值。"},"761":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"无环的共享节点按路径生成独立 draft，因此修改 `draft.left.value` 不一定修改\n`draft.right.value`。如果结果需要共享同一个节点，应显式赋值 `draft.right = draft.left`。"},"762":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#本地状态可以包含循环引用和共享引用吗","content":"Commit 重放和 history 会保留记录结果的引用关系，必要时使用快照。它们不会扩大 draft\n编辑的支持范围，共享传输仍然要求 JSON 树。"},"763":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#可以在-shared-client-上-persist-或-undo-吗","content":"不能。Persist 与 history 是权威端集成。client-local 写入会创造第二个 authority，并与其他镜像分叉。"},"764":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#adapter-可以作为一个-slice-吗","content":"不能。Zustand、MobX、Pinia、Jotai、Redux、Valtio 与 XState 集成都是 whole-store adapter。一个 store 应在原生 Coaction slices 与外部 adapter 之间选择。"},"765":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-包含-signal-primitive-吗","content":"包含，advanced `alien-signals` primitive 会被 re-export。普通应用派生状态仍应使用 getter 或 `get(deps, selector)`。"},"766":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#coaction-有-redux-devtools-集成吗","content":"当前没有作为维护的内置 contract。请使用 logger 与项目工具，不要只根据内部 hook 承诺 DevTools surface。"},"767":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/faq#什么时候应该选择-zustand","content":"当最重要的是极小 hook store、显式 selector、最小 bundle 和生态成熟度时，选择 Zustand。当自动渲染追踪、维护式缓存派生、自然 `this` action，或未来共享运行时能显著降低应用复杂度时，选择 Coaction。"},"768":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"page","content":"Store commits","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits"},"769":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","content":"通过 Coaction 的集成 contract 观察 transition、验证写入并 replay patch pair。"},"770":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"Commit 结构"},"771":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Hook 时机与生命周期"},"772":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#通过-store-replay","content":"通过 store replay"},"773":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","content":"Commit hooks 面向 history、持久化、同步等集成。应用代码通常通过命名 action 写入，通过框架订阅读取。\n这些 hooks 从 `coaction/adapter` 导入，也适用于由默认 local 入口创建的 store。"},"774":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`StoreCommit<T>` 包含该 transition 产生的状态和描述变化的 patch pair："},"775":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"字段"},"776":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"含义"},"777":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`state`"},"778":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"Transition 产生的状态，请作为只读值使用"},"779":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`patches`"},"780":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"从前一状态到当前状态的正向变化"},"781":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`inversePatches`"},"782":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"返回前一状态的逆向变化"},"783":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`source`"},"784":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`setState`、`mutableAction`、`external` 或 `replay`"},"785":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#commit-结构","content":"`store.apply` 的两种形式都会发布 commit。Listener 也能看到不经过 `apply` 的受支持 transition。\nPatches 可能替换发生变化的顶层字段，也可能使用 `path: []` 的完整 root snapshot 来保留本地图结构。\nCommit pair 不保证可以 JSON 序列化；共享 transport 与远程同步另有更严格的值 contract。"},"786":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"API"},"787":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"执行时机"},"788":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"用途"},"789":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"`onStoreCommit(store, listener)`"},"790":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Transition 提交后"},"791":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"观察已经接受的 transition"},"792":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"`onStoreCommitValidate(store, validator)`"},"793":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Transition 提交前"},"794":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"抛错以拒绝写入"},"795":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"`onStoreCommitPrepare(store, listener)`"},"796":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"准备包含对象值的 transition 时"},"797":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"返回 `true`，请求通过精确状态 replacement 处理图结构"},"798":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"任一注册都会在有效期内请求生成 patch pair，无需提前设置 `enablePatches: true`。\n每个注册函数返回可重复调用的 unsubscribe。Destroy 会释放注册；销毁后再次注册会抛错。"},"799":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Commit listener 先于普通 subscription 和 effect 执行。重入写入会先完成前一个 commit 的交付，再次修改状态。\nObserver 抛出的错误会在 commit 和 subscription 交付后返回调用者，不会回滚已经接受的 transition。"},"800":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#hook-时机与生命周期","content":"Validator 不得写入 store。抛错会在 Coaction 管理的 transition 修改状态前将其拒绝。\n直接修改外部 mutable instance 的行为，在 Coaction 观察到时已经发生，因此不能由 validator 撤销。\nPrepare listener 是处理对象图的集成 hook，不是通用的验证 hook。"},"801":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#通过-store-replay","content":"Replay 基于当前状态和完整 patch pair，经过验证、patch middleware、adapter writer 和通知链路，\n不能绕过 client mirror 的写入限制。History 应按正确顺序 replay，并避免把自身 undo 记录为新的用户编辑。\n可选的 `setState` 配置用于传入 middleware 作用域内的写入入口，使集成 wrapper 也能观察到 replay。"},"802":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/store-commits#通过-store-replay","content":"`apply` 所有权和图结构边界见 4.0 迁移；\n函数签名见生成式 API reference。"},"803":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"page","content":"支持矩阵","breadcrumbs":["Coaction","参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix"},"804":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","content":"原生 store、外部 adapter、middleware 与 Yjs 的维护组合。"},"805":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"原生 store"},"806":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#外部-adapter","content":"外部 adapter"},"807":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#middleware-与协作","content":"Middleware 与协作"},"808":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#框架-selector-边界","content":"框架 selector 边界"},"809":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#共享部署边界","content":"共享部署边界"},"810":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","content":"“支持”表示有测试覆盖，并作为维护 contract；“有限”表示保证比周围功能暗示的范围更窄。未列出的组合不应被推断为可用。"},"811":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"组合"},"812":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"状态"},"813":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"说明"},"814":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"单 store，local"},"815":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"支持"},"816":{"id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/reference/support-matrix#原生-store","content":"默认同步权威"